{"items":[{"id":"518520870","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"主要商城只有一个猴儿，太难了……[emot=acfun,2429/]","time":1634208867406,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"518521003","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"535674","name":"Dashi919","avatar":"66e316accbd00840d1943b66"},"text":"主要地主家也没有余粮，猴子今年经费少了很多，有钱，谁不想大气呢","time":1634208951704,"floor":1,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"518524164","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"265911","name":"相生.祐子","avatar":"ebff1c9ec381d2564c7d806e"},"text":"香蕉通货膨胀的日子早就过了，现在投蕉都扣扣索索的，在没资金进货的情况下，拼手速还不公平怎么公平？","time":1634209395597,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"518524200","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"367248","name":"蓝黑色","avatar":"225f59a2c6a7efddebe63b59"},"text":"物资不够更不能超发“货币”啊……建议猴子集体补课基本经济学","time":1634209404889,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"Dashi919","replyToUserId":"535674","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"518525469","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"22510649","name":"En2less_","avatar":"3bdba0b4365d25d1a5b11e73"},"text":"投蕉可以给up正反馈，也可以因为香蕉系统增加用户活跃度。其实说到底就是没有经费增加香蕉商城，不管是香蕉通货膨胀也好怎样也好，没有多的经费去购买香蕉商城的奖励，up手里囤积的香蕉越来越多，不就变成上架商品然后被抢了吗","time":1634209573368,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"518527785","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"382594","name":"扶香","avatar":"c0f90d971aaca772d661c7f2"},"text":"到现在还说香蕉多，那是你没怎么投，大多数活跃的人基本手头都存不了多少的。那次“超发”是借着活动给大家发香蕉，然后刺激大家直播跟稿件的投蕉，现在再来一次商城上新就等于回收香蕉，这套用户数量少，供应不足情况下的组合拳到你嘴里就成了没经济常识，我也是服了","time":1634209851549,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"蓝黑色","replyToUserId":"367248","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"518764663","root":"518520001","user":{"id":"522984","name":"火火火十八","avatar":"bbb68fdffbc2cf54f4b96f12"},"text":"这么久来，我只有在那一次活动感觉蕉够用","time":1634260765702,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"225f59a2c6a7efddebe63b59":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/EMATWcFcxGEfrhK3PiP1M7NkRR2sxQtI.jpg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/Vb5xMIVQvE-A7nAVb-3eYNja-nEfAnm-bUBFzy.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/style/image/201907/EMATWcFcxGEfrhK3PiP1M7NkRR2sxQtI.jpg"]},"3bdba0b4365d25d1a5b11e73":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2021_2_12/1.613095537847485E9.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/XnwqZFTqGw-BB7vAj-Jj6jYv-vym26j-ZJfu2y.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/content/2021_2_12/1.613095537847485E9.png"]},"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kc450zvGig-qAbMR3-i2Ifyy-NnuMJr-36baIv.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png"]},"66e316accbd00840d1943b66":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/535674_14e3d14aacc74df0945c7cdcefb2fa5c.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/qJ5vrrGPmX-vy6rQf-n2aYji-U3aq6z-J7ZFZb.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/535674_14e3d14aacc74df0945c7cdcefb2fa5c.png"]},"bbb68fdffbc2cf54f4b96f12":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/522984_8d68896d600641c5b75319e9a0838ed0.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/jibgObkqai-RbEjIj-Zf6fEn-f6JfQj-vMjyYz.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/522984_8d68896d600641c5b75319e9a0838ed0.png"]},"c0f90d971aaca772d661c7f2":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/HY3Wy753da8TP6khs